<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi (Vertebrate embryonic gut mucosa (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Mus musculus))",
        "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi faithfully reproduces Vertebrate embryonic gut mucosa (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Mus musculus) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Vertebrate embryonic gut mucosa (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Mus musculus) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-epithelial-buckling-crypt-villus-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Vertebrate embryonic gut mucosa (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Mus musculus)" ;
