<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Hannezo, Prost & Joanny's (2011) PRL and Shyer et al.'s (2013) Science mucosal bending rigidity B_e = E_e*h_e^3/(12*(1-nu^2)), Winkler foundation stiffness K_s = E_s/H_s, quartic characteristic length ell_* = (B_e/K_s)^(1/4) (L147-202), and a 2D pseudo-spectral L-BFGS-B Föppl-von Kármán free-energy minimizer (`relax_fvk_mucosal_surface`, L205-416) with all 5 FK506/surgical smooth-muscle ablation controls (L531-570), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_063_epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L976-1081) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 3-species wavelength Pearson r = 0.9996 (p = 1.6e-16, RMSE = 0.68 um), log-log scaling exponent alpha = 0.9571 ± 0.0085 (ref 1.0), Chick E10 ridge wavelength 119.28 um (ref 118.0 um), Chick E14 zigzag chevron angle 38.50 deg (ref 38.5 deg), Chick E16 hexagonal villus spacing 81.34 um (ref 82.0 um), E16 hexagonal order |Psi_6| = 0.7800 (ref 0.78), FK506@E6 ablation amplitude 0.0000 um (ref 0.0 um), specimen Delaunay coordination Z = 5.5517 (ref 6.0), and specimen spacing CV = 0.2441 (ref 0.22)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
