        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi — MorphoEval overall 93.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 93.1/100, up from 55.8/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a 2D pseudo-spectral Föppl-von Kármán / neo-Hookean mucosal free-energy functional via L-BFGS-B across all 4 sequential smooth-muscle regimes (E6 smooth -> E8/E10 1D longitudinal ridges -> E13/E14 2D herringbone zigzags -> E16 hexagonal villi & crypt invaginations); reproduces the 12-point 3-species wavelength scaling collapse across Chick, Quail, and Mouse (r = 0.9996, RMSE = 0.68 um, log-log exponent alpha = 0.9571 ± 0.0085); validates all 5 FK506 smooth-muscle inhibition and surgical slitting controls; and segments the SHA-256-locked CC0 histology specimen (`intestinal_villi_crypts_specimen.jpg`, n = 37 villi, Delaunay Z = 5.5517, spacing CV = 0.2441). Overall 93.0/100 (faithfulness 92.6, reproducibility 93.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus_comparison.png: rendered output of 2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py at e93f00e, image/png, 1085993 B, 2145×1412 px, artifact_sha256 45b455c27e8f12942e6ab7a976cb0b3ecfa1ebb241f2f74af193d1b10155ec23 (sha256 45b455c27e8f12942e6ab7a976cb0b3ecfa1ebb241f2f74af193d1b10155ec23), spec_fingerprint f6a04e7da51440cd41541428ef80cd7b7e9f5332411d929e37970e56635d68c5. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: f6a04e7da51440cd41541428ef80cd7b7e9f5332411d929e37970e56635d68c5; artifact_sha256: 45b455c27e8f12942e6ab7a976cb0b3ecfa1ebb241f2f74af193d1b10155ec23; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus_reference.json=1887bf2160034e33..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/intestinal_villi_crypts_specimen.jpg=30afcb789bbdc60c..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/paper_citations.bib=a8bc0251af8be542..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/scout_manifest.json=1e6e1bbc98fb4873...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-epithelial-buckling-crypt-villus-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D Föppl-von Kármán mucosal energy minimizer to a 3D tubular neo-Hookean finite-element mesh with spatially localized Shh/BMP mesenchymal cluster signaling at zigzag elbows." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

